    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_sub_004_dokuboss_first_07",
      "hash64": "F50D2C4DF406B092",
      "text": "The goods at this fine market are peddled via\\nauction, as thou mayst well already know.\\c\\nTherefore, whosoever craves my wares must first\\ntriumph in a battle of bargaining![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
